# Soulcoil Viper: "{B}, {T}, Sacrifice this creature: ..." The {T} in the cost cannot be paid by a creature that has not been under its
# controller's control continuously since the start of the turn (CR 302.6, 602.5b). Bot2 Bolts Bot1's Memnite on turn 2, so a legal
# target waits in Bot1's graveyard. On turn 3 Bot1 casts the Viper off a Black Lotus with a Swamp untapped to pay {B}, and cannot
# activate it the turn it enters; on turn 5 it can, and the Memnite returns.

